# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included (decisions.md 93).
# Without this, a Windows checkout turns every text file into CRLF and git shows them all as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
